  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Regional Refugee Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of UNICEF&apos;s Humanitarian Action for Children (HAC) for Ukraine and Refugee Response. UNICEF will sustain and expand its collaboration with national and local governrments to provide education, early learning, health, nutrition, child protection and social support for refugee families and children in Moldova. Cross-sectoral approaches in gender, adolescent development, and disability will be incorporated.</narrative>
  </description>
